      "text": "The well broke again. We are drinking rainwater till Thursday.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "context_tags": [
        "town",
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "My mule outran the constable. Whole street saw it.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "context_tags": [
        "town",
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Market was supposed to open at six. It opened at nine. Whatever.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "context_tags": [
        "town",
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "They say the ferry is fixed. They said that last month too.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "context_tags": [
        "town",
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Somebody's goat is loose in the chapel. Mass is cancelled.",
